+# imx95-devenv: ENETC0 VF1 (VSI1) is driven by Zephyr on the M7, Linux owns the PF.
+# NETC_ECAM: read PF SR-IOV VF-enable bits (VSI readiness gate).
+# NETC0: ENETC0 capability registers read by the NXP HAL.
+# NETC_LDID3: MSI/stream ID of ENETC0 VF1.
+NETC_ECAM           READONLY
+NETC0               READONLY
+NETC_VSI1           OWNER
+NETC_LDID3          OWNER, kpa=0, sid=0x22
+# imx95-devenv: USB2 (ChipIdea EHCI host, Type-A port) is driven by Zephyr on the M7.
+# Linux has no USB2 node; its DMA keeps stream ID 0xf (SMMU identity via m7-dma-handoff).
+USB2                OWNER, kpa=0, sid=0xf
 MU5_A               OWNER
 MU7_B               OWNER
 MU8_B               OWNER
